# SCOPE-FAR-HLOD (SCOPE-FAR-VIEW p4): the far city streamed by HLOD cells - the WP-FAR-8 hierarchy on real data.
# World: Scenes/WP_Protocol (WP-PROTOCOL.scn). Its layer HLOD_Main (Main grid, 25 m cells, LoadingRange 200 m) is
# spatially loaded: CellSize 51200 (512 m), LoadingRange 102400 (1024 m), ParentLayer HLOD_Main_Far (MeshMerge, always
# loaded - one merged mesh per 512 m cell). The 182 Main HLODs (178 L0 + 4 L5 cells) fall into 16 HLOD_Main cells,
# X,Z in -2..1 (7..13 HLODs each); 16 HLOD_Main_Far HLODs stand in for those cells. Foliage/Landscape layers unchanged.
# Source: the far flyer 9000003 (AlwaysLoaded, Scripts/World/WPFarFly.lua, TargetGrids Main+Foliage - the HLOD cells
# stream for it through Rules::HLODSources); Player 9000001 switched off. Flyer timeline (simulated s from Play):
# 0-30 hold at X=0, fly 250 m/s, 37-67 hold at X=1800 m, 80-110 hold at X=5000 m, back at X=0 from 130 s.
# Expected by band (editor.log, "[WorldPartition] 'WP_Protocol': ..."):
#   centre: "HLOD HLOD_Main(x,z) loaded at the start of Play, above the cells Edit kept." for all 16 (Load All kept
#           every Main cell); then Main cells beyond 200 m "unloaded."; the 16 HLOD_Main cells stay;
#   mid:    12 x "HLOD HLOD_Main(x,z) unloaded." for x = -2, -1, 0; the 4 of x = 1 stay loaded;
#   far:    the last 4 "HLOD HLOD_Main(1,z) unloaded." - 0 HLOD_Main cells, 0 Main cells;
#   back:   16 x "HLOD HLOD_Main(x,z) loaded, N HLOD record(s)", THEN "<Main cell> loaded" near X=0 (WorldGate: a Main
#           cell never activates before the HLOD cell above it).
# Frames: the city visible at every distance, never a hole, never two copies (a merged block over its instanced
# twin at a band edge). Camera 1003's Far 3.06 km is raised to 8 km (unsaved Edit) so the 5 km frame reaches it.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Scene "Build HLODs"
Дано run Panel "Open World Partition"
Дано run Scene "World Partition: Load All"
Дано set 9000001 StreamingSourceData.Enabled false
Дано set 9000003 StreamingSourceData.Enabled true
Дано set 1003 CameraData.Far 800000
Когда run Mode "Select mode"
Когда run Action "Play from Here"
Когда advance 10
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,40000,-60000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.6,1
Когда advance 2
Тогда far_hlod_centre центр (флаер над X=0): здания вокруг центра настоящие, весь город до края 1 км - HLOD_Main (инстансы), без дыр; лог: 16 HLOD_Main loaded at the start of Play
Когда advance 40
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 180000,30000,0
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -1,-0.2,0
Когда advance 2
Тогда far_hlod_mid 1.8 км к +X: ближняя колонка (X 0.5-1 км) - HLOD_Main, дальние 3/4 города - слитые блоки HLOD_Main_Far, на границе колонок ни дыры, ни двойного; лог: 12 x HLOD_Main(x<1) unloaded
Когда advance 40
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 500000,50000,0
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -1,-0.1,0
Когда advance 2
Тогда far_hlod_far 5 км: весь город виден мелко - 16 блоков HLOD_Main_Far, ни одной ячейки Main/HLOD_Main; лог: последние 4 HLOD_Main(1,z) unloaded
Когда advance 40
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,40000,-60000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.6,1
Когда advance 5
Тогда far_hlod_back снова центр: тот же вид, что far_hlod_centre (без двойной отрисовки); лог: 16 x HLOD_Main loaded, N HLOD record(s), затем Main cells loaded
Когда run Action "Stop"
